TEXT -16 8 Left 2 !.include ../models/12ax7_koren.sub\n.include ../models/el34_koren.sub\n.param AMP=1 PRESENCE=0.5 BIAS=-38\nV1 g1 0 SINE(0 {AMP} 1k) AC 1\nVplate B 0 360\nVbias VB 0 {BIAS}\n* long-tailed pair\nXA pa g1 tail 12AX7_KOREN\nXB pb g2 tail 12AX7_KOREN\nRpa B pa 82k\nRpb B pb 100k\nRg1 g1 0 1Meg\nRg2 g2 0 1Meg\nRtail_a tail tj 470\nRtail_b tj 0 10k\n* 0.022u coupling to the EL34 grids; 220k grid leaks return to the fixed bias supply\nCc1 pa ga1 0.022u\nCc2 pb ga2 0.022u\nRgl1 ga1 VB 220k\nRgl2 ga2 VB 220k\nRgs1 ga1 gg1 5.6k\nRgs2 ga2 gg2 5.6k\n* EL34 pair, cathodes grounded (fixed bias), 1k screen stoppers off the same B+\nXP1 P1 s1 gg1 0 EL34_KOREN\nXP2 P2 s2 gg2 0 EL34_KOREN\nRscr1 B s1 1k\nRscr2 B s2 1k\n* output transformer: centre-tapped 20H primary (two 5H halves) reflected 3.4k:16\n* Ls = 20H * 16/3400 = 94.12mH; primary copper 50R total (25R per half), secondary 0.3R\nRw1 P1 pa1 25\nLpa pa1 B 5H\nRw2 P2 pb1 25\nLpb B pb1 5H\nLs sec 0 94.12m\nK1 Lpa Lpb Ls 0.999\nRsw sec out 0.3\nRload out 0 16\n* global NFB from the secondary into the LTP tail, with the 5k presence pot + 0.1u shunt\nRnfb out tj 100k\nRpres tj pn {5k*PRESENCE}\nCpres pn 0 0.1u\n.step param PRESENCE list 0.1 0.5 0.9\n.options plotwinsize=0
